  "title": "explainCompletion response",
  "description": "GET /api/v3/completion: Whether an unattended run really finished: the outcome (completed, failed or not terminal), the lifecycle state and the evidence. Give exactly one of session (a session id), label (an exact, case-sensitive label, 1..200 characters) and attemptPart (0..512 characters; the empty part is allowed). A terminal outcome rests on observed evidence only. (response; generated from the route registry of @mcs/shared, docs/design/03-data-api-realtime.md section 13).",
